    "Each app and app extension installed with zLoader must register an App ID with Apple.\n\nApp IDs for paid developer accounts never expire, and there is no limit to how many you can create." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede mit zLoader installierte App und App-Erweiterung muss eine App-ID bei Apple registrieren.\n\nApp-IDs bezahlter Entwickler-Accounts laufen nicht ab. Ihre Anzahl ist nicht begrenzt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each app and app extension installed with zLoader must register an App ID with Apple.\n\nApp IDs for paid developer accounts never expire, and there is no limit to how many you can create."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app and app extension installed with zLoader must register an App ID with Apple. Apple limits non-developer Apple IDs to 10 App IDs at a time.\n\n**App IDs can't be deleted**, but they do expire after one week. zLoader will automatically renew App IDs for all active apps once they've expired." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede mit zLoader installierte App und App-Erweiterung muss eine App-ID bei Apple registrieren. Apple beschränkt normale Apple-Accounts auf gleichzeitig 10 App-IDs.\n\n**App-IDs können nicht gelöscht werden**, laufen aber nach einer Woche ab. zLoader erneuert sie automatisch für alle aktiven Apps."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each app and app extension installed with zLoader must register an App ID with Apple. Apple limits non-developer Apple IDs to 10 App IDs at a time.\n\n**App IDs can't be deleted**, but they do expire after one week. zLoader will automatically renew App IDs for all active apps once they've expired."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app and extension needs a matching profile. A wildcard profile cannot grant capabilities that Apple did not authorize." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede App und Extension benötigt ein passendes Profil. Ein Wildcard-Profil kann keine Capabilities freigeben, die Apple nicht autorisiert hat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
