    "Free developer accounts are limited to 1 active signing certificate. Since the private key for the active certificate was not found on this device, zLoader will create a new certificate. This will automatically revoke the active certificate, which may disable installations on other devices or made by Xcode." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kostenlose Entwickler-Accounts sind auf ein aktives Signierzertifikat begrenzt. Da der private Schlüssel dafür auf diesem Gerät fehlt, erstellt zLoader ein neues Zertifikat. Dabei wird das aktive Zertifikat automatisch widerrufen. Installationen auf anderen Geräten oder aus Xcode können dadurch unbrauchbar werden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free developer accounts are limited to 1 active signing certificate. Since the private key for the active certificate was not found on this device, zLoader will create a new certificate. This will automatically revoke the active certificate, which may disable installations on other devices or made by Xcode."
          }
        }
      }
    },
