    "Sources determine what apps are available in zLoader. The more sources you add, the better your zLoader experience will be.\n\nDon’t know where to start? Try adding one of our Recommended Sources!" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quellen bestimmen, welche Apps in zLoader verfügbar sind. Je mehr Quellen du hinzufügst, desto größer ist die Auswahl.\n\nDu weißt nicht, wo du anfangen sollst? Füge eine unserer empfohlenen Quellen hinzu!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sources determine what apps are available in zLoader. The more sources you add, the better your zLoader experience will be.\n\nDon’t know where to start? Try adding one of our Recommended Sources!"
          }
        }
      }
